nia.com/wrestling/torrie-wilson-gets-married/","line":167},{"title":"\"WWE Hall Of Famer Torrie Wilson Announces She Has Become A Mother At 50\"","target":"https://slamwrestling.net/news/wwe-hall-of-famer-torrie-wilson-announces-she-has-become-a-mother-at-50/","line":169},{"title":"archived","target":"https://ghostarchive.org/varchive/youtube/20211107/0wYgQCHvFUo","line":171},{"title":"*Torrie Wilson: Where Are They Now?*","target":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0wYgQCHvFUo","line":171},{"title":"WWE","target":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WWE \"WWE\"","line":173},{"title":"Archived","target":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190407044059/https://www.wwe.com/article/al-wilson-passes-away","line":173},{"title":"\"Al Wilson passes away\"","target":"https://www.wwe.com/article/al-wilson-passes-away","line":173},{"title":"Archived","target":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190406231857/http://www.prowrestlingsheet.com/torrie-wilson-father-dies/#.XKk9oJhKjcs","line":175},{"title":"\"Torrie Wilson's Father Al Wilson Passes Away\"","target":"https://www.prowrestlingsheet.com/torrie-wilson-father-dies/#.XKk9oJhKjcs","line":175},{"title":"Archived","target":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190409185115/http://www.wrestleview.com/results/raw/raw2006/1160450871.shtml","line":177},{"title":"\"Raw Results – 10/9/06 – Columbia, SC ('Raw Family Reunion' Results)\"","target":"https://www.wrestleview.com/results/raw/raw2006/1160450871.shtml","line":177},{"title":"Archived","target":"https://web.archive.org/web/20210124083239/https://www.wrestlingdata.com/index.php?befehl=bios&wrestler=213","line":179},{"title":"\"Torrie Wilson\"","target":"https://www.wrestlingdata.com/index.php?befehl=bios&wrestler=213","line":179},{"title":"Archived","target":"https://web.archive.org/web/20180917063938/http://www.wrestleview.com/news/1048835437.shtml","line":181},{"title":"\"Full WWE SmackDown Results – 3/27/03 (3 Days Before WrestleMania)\"","target":"https://www.wrestleview.com/news/1048835437.shtml","line":181},{"title":"Archived","target":"https://web.archive.org/web/20180917063530/http://www.wrestleview.com/news/1057946875.shtml","line":183},{"title":"\"Full WWE SmackDown Results – 07/10/03 – (3 on 1 Handicap Match)\"","target":"https://www.wrestleview.com/news/1057946875.shtml","line":183},{"title":"WWE","target":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WWE \"WWE\"","line":185},{"title":"Archived","target":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190408023346/https://www.wwe.com/videos/what-is-torrie-wilson-dog-chloe-up-to-where-are-they-now-extra","line":185},{"title":"\"What is Torrie Wilson's dog Chloe up to: Where Are They Now? Extra\"","target":"https://www.wwe.com/videos/what-is-torrie-wilson-dog-chloe-up-to-where-are-they-now-extra","line":185},{"title":"WWE","target":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WWE \"WWE\"","line":187},{"title":"Archived","target":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190920172138/https://www.wwe.com/inside/top25/impactfulwomen/page-13","line":187},{"title":"\"Top 25 Most Impactful Women\"","target":"https://www.wwe.com/inside/top25/impactfulwomen/page-13","line":187},{"title":"\"Torrie Wilson On The WWE Divas Era, Dawn Marie & Al Wilson, Difference Between WCW & WWE\"","target":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aAIYrWJyheI","line":189},{"title":"\"Torrie Wilson Hated Doing Bikini Contests\"","target":"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/yXi81nCIAW4","line":191},{"title":"\"WWE Hall Of Famer Torrie Wilson Admits Bikini Contests Were \"Mortifying\" And Left Women In Tears\"","target":"https://theringreport.com/wwe/wwe-hall-of-famer-torrie-wilson-admits-bikini-contests-were-mortifying-and-left-women-in-tears-a23528","line":193},{"title":"\"Torrie Wilson on Highs and Lows of Wrestling Career, Kissing Vince McMahon In Debut, Biggest Regrets\"","target":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IoZserwkNlQ","line":195},{"title":"\"Torrie Wilson Says WWE Wanted Her To Use Body Paint for Infamous Bikini Contest Segment\"","target":"https://411mania.com/wrestling/torrie-wilson-body-paint-infamous-bikini-contest/","line":197},{"title":"\"Torrie Wilson opened up about some of her most intimidating and controversial moments in WWE, including her first day on the job. She recalled \"It was obviously extremely intimidating working with Vince the first day and kissing Vince first day\", explaining that she handled it by simply pushing herself forward: \"Just felt someone push me on the back and just do it.\" Interestingly, she noted that Vince's wife Linda was present during the moment, \"kind of helping navigate it all,\" which left her unsure whether it made the situation better or more awkward. Despite the discomfort, Torrie emphasized she was mainly focused on her career: \"I was just really happy to have a big role on TV then.\" Torrie also reflected on moments in WWE where she felt things crossed the line, particularly with sexualized segments. She cited \"The Judgment Day PPV bikini contest against Sable\", where Vince had originally wanted her to do hand paint on her chest like Sable had done. She stated, \"I just didn't feel comfortable doing that.\" She admitted that looking back at her on-screen appearances in minimal attire often makes her cringe: \"Those times really do kind of make me cringe… Sometimes you can see kids in the crowd and it just felt like 'this is wrong.'\" Source: The Ariel Helwani Show – DarKNaTaS (Admin)\"","target":"https://www.facebook.com/PWMMANews/posts/torrie-wilson-opened-up-about-some-of-her-most-intimidating-and-controversial-mo/1098987565777949/","line":199},{"title":"\"WWE Champions\"","target":"https://twitter.com/WWEChampions/status/1661915065162035200","line":201},{"title":"Archived","target":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240227000103/https://twitter.com/WWEChampions/status/1661915065162035200","line":201},{"title":"Archived","target":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230526024657/https://wwechampions.scopely.com/2023/05/25/fighting-fit-flash-feuds/","line":203},{"title":"\"Fighting Fit Flash Feuds – WWE Champions\"","target":"https://wwechampions.scopely.com/2023/05/25/fighting-fit-flash-feuds/","line":203},{"title":"\"wwe.2k.com\"","target":"https://wwe.2k.com/en-GB/2k26/ringside-pass/","line":205},{"title":"the original","target":"http://trifitnesschallenge.com/index.php/news/trifitness-challenge-home/2012-tri-fitness-hall-of-fame/","line":207},{"title":"\"2012 Tri-Fitness Hall of Fame\"","target":"https://web.archive.org/web/20120615230828/http://trifitnesschallenge.com/index.php/news/trifitness-challenge-home/2012-tri-fitness-hall-of-fame/","line":207}],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
